1
00:00:00,821 --> 00:00:04,201
(Leonard:)I deliberately tried to sabotage
Stuart's date with Penny.

2
00:00:04,367 --> 00:00:07,827
(Raj:)Of course you feel terrible. You completely
screwed up your karma, dude.

3
00:00:07,995 --> 00:00:10,455
(Sheldon:)You don't really believe in that superstition,
do you?

4
00:00:10,623 --> 00:00:13,463
(Raj:)It's not superstition,
it's practically Newtonian.

5
00:00:14,043 --> 00:00:16,463
(Raj:)For every action,
there's an equal and opposite reaction.

6
00:00:16,629 --> 00:00:20,469
(Raj:)Leonard pretends to be a friend,
and acts like a two-faced bitch.

7
00:00:22,510 --> 00:00:25,510
(Raj:)Therefore, he is reborn as a banana slug.

8
00:00:27,973 --> 00:00:31,813
(Raj:)It's actually a very elegant system.
You know, what goes around comes around.

9
00:00:31,977 --> 00:00:34,937
(Howard:)Speaking of what goes around
comes around...

10
00:00:35,606 --> 00:00:36,686
(Raj:)Okay, look.

11
00:00:36,857 --> 00:00:39,607
(Raj:)Instead of trying to reinforce
this structure here...

12
00:00:39,777 --> 00:00:42,237
...what if we ran another line,
bypassed it entirely?

13
00:00:42,405 --> 00:00:44,985
(Sheldon:)Won't work.
The diameter of the tubing is insufficient.

14
00:00:45,157 --> 00:00:47,157
(Raj:)What if we reposition
the collection tank?

15
00:00:47,326 --> 00:00:48,956
(Sheldon:)It won't work. No way to mount it.

16
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,200
(Howard:)Here's an idea.
What if I change my name...

17
00:00:51,372 --> 00:00:54,252
(Howard:)...and go live with my cousin
and her husband, Avi, in Israel?

18
00:00:56,460 --> 00:01:04,020
(Sheldon:)That could work.

